### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz


### Readiness Probe
GET http://localhost:8080/ready


### Prometheus Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics


### Search Routes (Bounding Box)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boundingBox": [-2.984805, 54.418630, -2.947941, 54.438327]
}


### Search Routes (Full Text Query)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Locking"
}


### Search Routes (Nearby)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nearby": {
    "lat": 54.42,
    "lon": -2.97,
    "distance": 5000
  }
}


### Search Routes (with Facets)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Locking",
  "facets": ["surface"]
}


### Count All Routes
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/count
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boundingBox": [-2.984805, 54.418630, -2.947941, 54.438327]
}


### Get Route by Object ID
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/1
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}


### Facet Counts
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/facets/surface
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 10
}


### CORS Preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
Origin: http://example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: X-API-Key, Content-Type


### Unauthorized (No API Key)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "test"
}


### Rate Limited (send multiple times rapidly)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/gps-routes/search
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "test"
}
